<title>PORTUGAL: BA Credit Card launches 7-yr 7.5 bln esc Navigator.</title>
<headline>BA Credit Card launches 7-yr 7.5 bln esc Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BA Credit Card launched a seven-year 7.5 billion escudo Navigator bond at three-month Lisbor plus 15 basis points (bp), the leaders of the operation said.  </p>
<p>This is the first &quot;asset backed securitisation&quot; Navigator on a portfolio of Visa and MasterCard credit cards managed by Bank of America NA, a statement said.</p>
<p>The leaders of the issue are Banco Finantia, Banco Cisf and Banco Mello de Investimentos. Salomon Brothers Int. London is co-leader.</p>
</text>
